/*! \page history Version History

<strong>Release 1.42 - September 2026</strong>

- Added a cmake build that sits alongside the existing build using the manually maintained Visual Studio solution files

- Made the cmake build of the C++ addin work on Linux with gcc: portable WIN32/MSVC guards, gensrc moved into its own gensrc/CMakeLists.txt (optional QLA_RUN_GENSRC step), and a native linux-gcc preset

- Reenabled the C++ addin.  In the visual studio build, the build of the C++
  addin was still working.  Fixed a problem where the build would fail if
  doxygen were not installed.  Extended the cmake build to support the build of
  the C++ addin.

- Added FX forward instrument and DiscountingFxForwardEngine (thanks to Mike Scaturo)

- Added new ratehelpers and updated example sheet (thanks to Sebastian Schlenkrich)

- Updated for compatibility with the ORE fork of QuantLib:

  - qlCalendarHolidayList: Calendar::holidayList() changed from static to instance
    method; updated gensrc metadata from Procedure/alias to EnumerationMember

  - qlCalendarAdvance: Calendar::advance() gained an optional 5th parameter;
    suppressed in gensrc metadata and reimplemented manually in manual.cpp /
    loop_calendar_manual.hpp with the correct cmf5 bind signature

  - qlBondAtmRateFromYieldTermStructure, qlBondYieldFromCleanPrice,
    qlBondZSpreadFromCleanPrice: BondFunctions now requires Bond::Price wrapper
    for clean price arguments; suppressed in gensrc metadata (bonds.xml)

  - qlModelG2Calibrate, qlOneFactorAffineModelCalibrate: CalibratedModel::calibrate()
    now takes CalibrationHelper instead of BlackCalibrationHelper; suppressed in
    gensrc metadata (calibrationhelpers.xml)

  - qlFRAforwardValue, qlFRAspotValue: ForwardRateAgreement::forwardValue() and
    spotValue() removed; suppressed in gensrc metadata (forwardrateagreement.xml)

  - qlBucketAnalysis, qlBucketAnalysisDelta, qlBucketAnalysisDelta2:
    SensitivityAnalysis and underlying bucket analysis removed; suppressed in
    gensrc metadata (quotes.xml); enum definition removed from QuantLibAddin

  - qlRiskyFixedBond: QuantLib::RiskyFixedBond removed; suppressed in gensrc
    metadata (credit.xml); class commented out in credit.hpp/credit.cpp

  - qlCaAsianOption, qlDaAsianOption: confirmed working under the ORE fork;
    no changes required

  - OvernightIndexedSwap::Type collapsed into VanillaSwap::Type (both are
    Swap::Type); removed duplicate registration from enumeratedtypes.xml,
    types.xml, and overnightindexedswap.xml to avoid heap corruption on unload

  - CmsMarketCalibration: updated include from swaptionvolcube1.hpp to
    sabrswaptionvolatilitycube.hpp in gensrc metadata (cmsmarketcalibration.xml)

  - swaptionvolstructure.cpp, dividendvanillaoption.cpp, credit.cpp: updated for
    renamed/removed QuantLib classes

- Upgraded project files to VS2026 (v145 toolset)

- Visual Studio project files: Redirect Debug PDB output to OutDir to avoid mspdbsrv post-build copy lock

- Added qlRiskyBondEngine pricing engine, qlFraAmount FRA payoff function, and renamed qlFRAforwardRate
  to qlFraForwardRate; removed qlFixedRateBond2: deleted the QuantLibAddin wrapper constructor that accepted
  a vector of InterestRate objects as coupons, on the grounds that the same bond can be constructed via the
  simpler qlFixedRateBond interface which takes raw Rate values and a DayCounter directly (thanks to Francois Botha)

<strong>Release 1.22.0 - May 2021</strong>

- Deleted obsolete classes FDAmericanEngine, FDEuropeanEngine, FDBermudanEngine

<strong>Release 1.21.0 - January 2021</strong>

- Implemented new function qlSwapNumberOfLegs() (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Added more aliases for Actual/365 (No Leap) day counter (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Added CompoundedThenSimple compounding rule (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Upgraded gensrc source code generation scripts from python 2 to 3 (thanks to Francois Botha)

<strong>Release 1.20.0 - November 2020</strong>

- Consolidated project files and upgraded to VS2019 (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Added enumeration UnitedStates::FederalReserve with alias US Fedwire System (thanks to Mike DelMedico)

- Added Botswana calendar (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Added U as alias for Unadjusted business day convention (thanks to Francois Botha)

<strong>Release 1.16.0 - October 2019</strong>

- Replaced deprecated Actual365NoLeap() with Actual365Fixed(Actual365Fixed::NoLeap) (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Implemented qlScheduleFullInterfaceFromDateVector in order to create schedule with full interface from date vector (thanks to Francois Botha)

- Extended OISRateHelper with payment lag parameter (thanks to BN Algorithms Ltd)

- Extended qlMakeOIS with payment lag parameter (thanks to BN Algorithms Ltd)

- Corrected InterestRateDerivatives example spreadsheet (thanks to BN Algorithms Ltd)

